<MainLayout title="Home">
  <section>
    <h2>Who to Pray To</h2>
    <p>This site presents a practical, reflective exploration of prayer, belief, and the search for guidance in a plural world.</p>
    <p>The pages in the menu follow the structure from the document and offer three rationales for approaching prayer: seeking an advocate, choosing a belief system with the least harm, and looking for evidence that may support a broader view of the afterlife.</p>
    <p>Use the navigation to move through the sections and read the ideas in the order they were presented.</p>
  </section>
</MainLayout>
